Within each collection/&lt;family&gt;/ directory, or its corresponding directory
in a release archive, this choice covers the following original project work:

- Desktop fonts in fonts/ (.otf and .ttf).
- Webfonts in web/ (.woff and .woff2).
- Editable font source data under source/ (.ttx, .json and .svg), including
  masters, glyph outlines, tracing data and reviewed font approximations.

It also covers the generated browsing fonts in site/icon-fonts/ (.woff2).
The license field in font.json describes this Font Software, rather than
every file in a family directory.

